<div class="ga-story-page-wrapper" style="padding: 0 0 2rem 0;">
  
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="ga-story-hero" style="background: linear-gradient(rgba(26, 51, 44, 0.9), rgba(26, 51, 44, 0.9)), url('{{ 'ghar-aangan-hero-banner.jpg' | asset_url }}') no-repeat center center; background-size: cover; padding: 10rem 2rem; text-align: center; border-radius: 16px; margin-bottom: 6rem; border: 1px solid var(--ga-border-color); box-shadow: var(--ga-card-shadow);">
    <div style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <span class="ga-subtitle" style="color: var(--ga-gold-cream); font-size: 1.4rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em;">OUR ROOTS & VALUES</span>
      <h1 class="ga-title ga-text-white" style="color: #ffffff; font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 6vw, 5.2rem); margin-top: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; line-height: 1.2; font-family: var(--ga-font-family-serif);">Ghar Jaisa Shuddh,<br>Parampara Jaisa Anmol</h1>
      <p class="ga-body" style="color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85); font-size: 1.7rem; line-height: 1.7; font-weight: 300;">
        At Ghar Aangan, we believe that food is more than nourishment—it is tradition, heritage, family, and trust. Inspired by the timeless kitchens of Uttarakhand, our mission is to reconnect modern families with authentic Himalayan foods prepared using traditional methods that have been preserved for generations.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The Journey Section (Split) -->
  <style>
    .ga-journey-split {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 8rem;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
    }
    @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
      .ga-journey-split {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
        gap: 6rem;
      }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="ga-journey-split">
    <!-- Left Arched Image -->
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="ga-arch-container ga-reveal" style="max-width: 100%;">
        <img class="ga-arch-top" src="{{ 'ghar-aangan-lifestyle.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Ghar Aangan Founder's Story" style="width: 100%; max-width: 400px; height: auto; display: block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Right Text -->
    <div class="ga-reveal">
      <span class="ga-subtitle">THE FOUNDER'S JOURNEY</span>
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Back to the Soil</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        Having grown up in the pristine valleys of Uttarakhand, our founder witnessed the steady industrialization of food production, resulting in the loss of traditional agricultural methods and food preparation heritage. Everyday foods in stores became heavily processed, stripped of their natural nutrition and local flavors.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        Determined to preserve ancestral knowledge, they returned to rural farming communities in Uttarakhand. Collaborating with small local households and self-help women's collectives, they established a fair-trade supply network, giving birth to Ghar Aangan: bringing authentic Himalayan foods directly to your doorstep.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- The Terroir Section (Reverse Split) -->
  <div class="ga-journey-split">
    <!-- Image (top on mobile, right on desktop) -->
    <div class="ga-story-col-img ga-reveal" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="ga-arch-container">
        <img class="ga-arch-top" src="{{ 'ghar-aangan-product-ghee.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="High Altitude Badri cows ghee" style="width: 100%; max-width: 400px; height: auto; display: block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Text (bottom on mobile, left on desktop) -->
    <div class="ga-story-col-txt ga-reveal" style="text-align: left;">
      <span class="ga-subtitle">HIMALAYAN HERITAGE</span>
      <h2 class="ga-title" style="font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Purity from the High Altitudes</h2>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        Our products originate in the pristine, high-altitude valleys of Uttarakhand. From handcrafted Bilona A2 Ghee made from indigenous Badri cows to mountain-grown grains, heritage pulses, natural jaggery, medicinal fruit squashes, and traditional Himalayan seasonings, every product carries the warmth of home.
      </p>
      <p class="ga-body" style="font-size: 1.55rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ga-dark-text); font-weight: 300;">
        We work directly with local farmers and Himalayan communities to preserve food traditions while supporting sustainable livelihoods. By using ancestral clarification and processing methods, we ensure that every jar and package retains the pure life-force (Prana) and nutritional value of the mountains.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

